    "description": "<p><em>agente de inteligência</em></p><p>Especialização de Operativo, para Afiliação <strong>Leal</strong>, escolhida no <strong>5º nível</strong>. Mantém tudo o que o Operativo já lhe deu, e as habilidades da classe seguem na ficha.</p><p><strong>Progressão do Espião — do 5º ao 20º nível</strong></p><table><thead><tr><th>Nv</th><th>Sabotagem</th><th>Rodadas</th><th>Escalar</th><th>Furtividade</th><th>Furtar</th><th>Percepção</th><th>Atq. Furtivo</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>5</strong></td><td><strong>40%</strong></td><td>1d8</td><td>84%</td><td>40%</td><td>40%</td><td>1-3</td><td>×2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>6</strong></td><td><strong>45%</strong></td><td>1d6</td><td>85%</td><td>45%</td><td>45%</td><td>1-3</td><td>×3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7</strong></td><td><strong>50%</strong></td><td>1d6</td><td>86%</td><td>50%</td><td>50%</td><td>1-3</td><td>×3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>8</strong></td><td><strong>55%</strong></td><td>1d6</td><td>87%</td><td>55%</td><td>55%</td><td>1-3</td><td>×3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>9</strong></td><td><strong>60%</strong></td><td>1d6</td><td>88%</td><td>60%</td><td>60%</td><td>1-3</td><td>×3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>10</strong></td><td><strong>65%</strong></td><td>1d6</td><td>89%</td><td>65%</td><td>65%</td><td>1-4</td><td>×3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>11</strong></td><td><strong>70%</strong></td><td>1d4</td><td>90%</td><td>70%</td><td>70%</td><td>1-4</td><td>×3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>12</strong></td><td><strong>72%</strong></td><td>1d4</td><td>91%</td><td>72%</td><td>72%</td><td>1-4</td><td>×4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>13</strong></td><td><strong>74%</strong></td><td>1d4</td><td>92%</td><td>74%</td><td>74%</td><td>1-4</td><td>×4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>14</strong></td><td><strong>76%</strong></td><td>1d4</td><td>93%</td><td>76%</td><td>76%</td><td>1-4</td><td>×4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>15</strong></td><td><strong>78%</strong></td><td>1d4</td><td>94%</td><td>78%</td><td>78%</td><td>1-4</td><td>×4</td></tr><tr